{"id":"6b640d7acb936fa5","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Distributivity Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number — ZFC CI Distributivity Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number — ZFC CI Distributivity Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number — ZFC CI Distributivity Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak h,A,B,p,q\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak h,A,B,p,q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fin},\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^+\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fin},\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^+\\in V\\)</span>（下述有限理想、商代数及其正部分）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinEq}_S,\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinEq}_S,\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（下述模有限等价与商序）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DO}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{DO}:V\\to V\\)</span>（下述稠密开集族构造）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiDistributivityNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiDistributivityNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}finite\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{Fin}\\coloneqq[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}finite\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{Fin}\\coloneqq[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}finite\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{FinEq}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}finite\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{FinEq}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\\mathbb B\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\omega)/\\mathrm{FinEq}_S\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathbb B^+\\coloneqq\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{[\\varnothing]_{\\mathrm{FinEq}_S}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\\mathbb B\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\omega)/\\mathrm{FinEq}_S\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathbb B^+\\coloneqq\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{[\\varnothing]_{\\mathrm{FinEq}_S}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(p,q)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb B\\land q\\in\\mathbb B\\land\\exists A\\in p\\;\\exists B\\in q\\;(A\\setminus B\\in\\mathrm{Fin})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(p,q)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb B\\land q\\in\\mathbb B\\land\\exists A\\in p\\;\\exists B\\in q\\;(A\\setminus B\\in\\mathrm{Fin})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open}\\vdash\\mathrm{DO}(\\mathbb B^+)\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathbb B^+:\\bigl(\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\bigr)\\land\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;(\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\to q\\in D)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open}\\vdash\\mathrm{DO}(\\mathbb B^+)\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathbb B^+:\\bigl(\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\bigr)\\land\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;(\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\to q\\in D)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}distributivity\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiDistributivityNumber}_S(\\mathfrak h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak h)\\land\\mathfrak h=\\min\\Bigl\\{|\\mathcal D|:\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{DO}(\\mathbb B^+)\\land\\neg\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;\\exists q\\in\\bigcap\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}distributivity\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiDistributivityNumber}_S(\\mathfrak h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak h)\\land\\mathfrak h=\\min\\Bigl\\{|\\mathcal D|:\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{DO}(\\mathbb B^+)\\land\\neg\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;\\exists q\\in\\bigcap\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Removing the zero element is essential: on the full Boolean algebra the singleton <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span> is dense, which would collapse the intended forcing/distributivity invariant.</li>\n<li>商对象现在按对称差有限显式定义，商序按几乎包含显式定义；不再把有限理想本身误当作等价关系或留下未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak h,A,B,p,q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fin},\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^+\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinEq}_S,\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DO}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiDistributivityNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}finite\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{Fin}\\coloneqq[\\omega]^{<\\omega}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}finite\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{FinEq}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\in\\mathrm{Fin}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\\mathbb B\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\omega)/\\mathrm{FinEq}_S\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathbb B^+\\coloneqq\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{[\\varnothing]_{\\mathrm{FinEq}_S}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(p,q)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb B\\land q\\in\\mathbb B\\land\\exists A\\in p\\;\\exists B\\in q\\;(A\\setminus B\\in\\mathrm{Fin})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open}\\vdash\\mathrm{DO}(\\mathbb B^+)\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathbb B^+:\\bigl(\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\bigr)\\land\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;(\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\to q\\in D)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}distributivity\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiDistributivityNumber}_S(\\mathfrak h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak h)\\land\\mathfrak h=\\min\\Bigl\\{|\\mathcal D|:\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{DO}(\\mathbb B^+)\\land\\neg\\forall p\\in\\mathbb B^+\\;\\exists q\\in\\bigcap\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{QuotientLe}_S(q,p)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}","display":false}],"bytes":2579,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1609","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number.md|58-df-zfc-ci-distributivity-number]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}